She compliments your baby poster.

1375
01:05:37.530 --> 01:05:38.650
It doesn't matter.

1376
01:05:38.830 --> 01:05:39.710
It doesn't matter.

1377
01:05:39.810 --> 01:05:40.210
I know.

1378
01:05:40.410 --> 01:05:41.630
She really is.

1379
